Umbrella CloudBSD metaport for GPU DRM kernel modules.

Selects the CloudBSD split stack for the running FreeBSD version
(mirrors stock drm-kmod):

  - FreeBSD >= 1500509 amd64 → cloudbsd-drm-612-kmod
  - FreeBSD >= 1500031 amd64 → cloudbsd-drm-66-kmod
  - older / other → cloudbsd-drm-61-kmod

Also available explicitly:
  cloudbsd-drm-515-kmod, cloudbsd-drm-61-kmod, cloudbsd-drm-66-kmod,
  cloudbsd-drm-612-kmod, cloudbsd-drm-latest-kmod
